# rp2350

`openocd -f interface/cmsis-dap.cfg -f target/rp2350.cfg -c "adapter speed 5000"`

need to use the https://github.com/raspberrypi/openocd/ fork which has the rp2350 config

load over gdb with `target extended-remote localhost:3333` when linker setup everything in SRAM
then you can just do `monitor reset init` `load kernel.elf` `continue`

